'''''Todd Riordan's Academic Research: Continued''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[The Xianzhou Luofu]].

==Steps==
# Head to the designated location to meet Todd
# Talk to Todd and make your choice
# Go to the Realm-Keeping Commission and report on Todd's doings
# Go to Petrichor Inn to ask the Ten-Lords Commission judge for information
# Maybe Todd will contact me tomorrow. Who knows...
# View the message from Todd
# Head to the coast and meet with Todd
# View the message from Todd
# Head to Starskiff Haven and meet with Todd
# Follow Todd to the food stall
# Fulfill Todd's wish and buy him a berrypheasant skewer
# Give the berrypheasant skewer you bought to Todd
# Accompany Todd to wander and stroll around the Exalting Sanctum
# Head to the Scalegorge Waterscape coast and talk with Todd
# Maybe Todd will contact me tomorrow. Who knows...

